      "## From awareness to action",
      "The ACA Multicultural and Social Justice Counseling Competencies emphasize development across attitudes and beliefs, knowledge, skills, and action. Reflection without action can leave barriers unchanged; action without reflection can reproduce paternalism or harm.",
      "Counselors consider:",
      "- Their own identities, power, assumptions, and social position\n- The client's identities, worldview, strengths, and experiences\n- Dynamics of power and culture in the counseling relationship\n- Institutional, community, and policy conditions\n- Interventions at the level where the barrier is produced",
