      "- Is this the client's goal or mine?\n- What risks would the client bear?\n- Does the client want individual coping, relational change, institutional advocacy, public action, or a combination?\n- Am I making assumptions about what liberation should look like?\n- Can disagreement remain safe in the counseling relationship?",
      "Social justice is not served by coercing a client into activism.",
      "## Levels of advocacy",
      "Action can occur with affected people or on their behalf. Whenever possible, center the voices, leadership, and consent of people who bear the consequences.",
      "## Professional advocacy",
      "Professional advocacy supports conditions that allow counselors to serve the public effectively, such as:",
