      "**Evidence-label trap:** accepting a marketing claim without appraisal.",
      "**Manual trap:** following a protocol without client fit or feedback.",
      "**Preference trap:** treating preference as permission for unsafe care.",
      "**Tradition trap:** continuing an ineffective practice because it is familiar.",
      "**Outcome-only trap:** ignoring burden, harm, alliance, or equity."
